 # API

-JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md`.
+JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md` (including `GET /audit`).
+
+## Authentication and roles
+
+Requests carry `Authorization: Bearer <key>`, matched against `apiKeys` in the
+store (`{ key, name, role }`). Missing or unknown keys return `401`
+(`unauthorized`); keys without permission return `403` (`forbidden`).
+
+- `viewer`: `GET` routes only (except `GET /audit`).
+- `cook`: `viewer` permissions plus `POST /recipes/:id/cook`,
+  `POST /batches/:id/waste`, `POST /temperatures` and
+  `POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`.
+- `manager`: every route, including `GET /audit`.

 ## Errors

